## Consequence

The previously unexplained component-20 dimensions now have a selected
geometric interpretation. The 100-dimensional kernel is exhausted by the
first four conic-normal layers, while its 36-dimensional complement is the
fourth-normal carrier `q^4 Sym^7`. Independently, the selected G3BI correction
already emits an exact degree-seven conic quotient `D7` of that same
dimension.

This is stronger than a recurring modular rank profile: it identifies the
specific root-conic filtration and an exact characteristic-zero source with
the required carrier size.

## Claim Boundary

G3FF does not yet prove that the two exact structures are the same operator.
In particular it does not prove:

```text
endpoint component-20 quotient = q^4 Sym^7,
```

does not promote the finite kernels themselves to `Q(gamma)`, and does not by
itself prove the component-20 rank contribution 36 or the global H02 rank.

## Next Required Object

